## Predicting a brand-new office

```{r new-office}
tibble(city = "NEW_OFFICE") |>
  add_epred_draws(fit_ml, allow_new_levels = TRUE) |>
  mean_qi(.epred, .width = 0.95)
```

It expects it near the grand mean, with uncertainty set by how much
offices differ. **No-pooling could not do this at all.**

